{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"c32cbe702aadcaf144ef106bc948fafa7f2c8f7018c548985d66a65239bc6436","ja":"やよいとのり子が考えたみんなのマスコットを、\nSNSにアップしてから数日後……","zh":"把弥生和法子想出来的大家的吉祥物\n发到SNS上几天后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d668f81056960e43913d0c45bd4f30d68d53e06f2848c9826bac8ff4e1a45496","ja":"あっ！　のり子さん！\nみんなからの反応が、すごいことになってますよ！","zh":"啊！法子！\n大家的反应非常热烈哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e8c6236de480597605cba5bb79b60aebba6dbbe56a2cb725969416c741d0c9c8","ja":"アタシも見たよ。たくさんコメントついてたね！\r\n「一緒に戦っているところを見てみたい」とか♪","zh":"我也看了哦。有好多评论呢！\n比如“想看并肩作战的样子”之类的♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"72ca74224623974fc1a925059d4af27c092058930ddd948b698eb6d22c165eb9","ja":"それだけじゃなくって……ファンの人たちから、\nこういうのも届いたらしくって……！","zh":"还不止这些……粉丝们好像\n还送来了这种东西……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"858827ecfce92cdfee6bc25c116b23e5d2b33d88a25843a329229e922f68587e","ja":"ええっ！？　手作りのぬいぐるみに、キーホルダーに\n……変形フィギュアまでっ！","zh":"咦咦！？不仅有亲手做的玩偶、钥匙扣\n……甚至还有变形手办！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8c484a942524907117ceded5cdc44070b89c00ce6fb2d91562f4f23d98a59a18","ja":"これ全部、アタシたちが考えたマスコットを\nモチーフにしてくれてるんだ！？","zh":"这些全都是以我们想出来的吉祥物\n为原型设计的吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"dc004033cd06ad143bdf799269f4f61ca2d4f33878d7daa5656e201a2a88df15","ja":"うっう～！　鉄板くんのぬいぐるみも、\nすっごくかわいく作ってくれたんですよ！","zh":"呜～呜～！铁板君的玩偶也\n被做得超级可爱哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"9caab88ede9ddd11d54231621e1d06903a9bfc2321c491b65fafdf374bceb847","ja":"アタシのクラウザー号ロボットのフィギュアも\nかっこいい！　手作りでこんなのできるなんて……。","zh":"我的克劳泽号机器人手办也\n好帅！　纯手工居然能做成这样……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"dc739ba05ca36bcd592a15ff814772b0326d79aae08fe04fb84272d7536fd8d1","ja":"これ、ヒーローもので出てきてもおかしくないくらい\nクオリティ高いよねっ！？","zh":"这个就算出现在英雄片里也毫不违和，\n品质超高的对吧！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"843952601d1285accb7a1863909e79a5ba1cb40f9b37b9e46c1746f6842e093e","ja":"はい、どれもとーってもかっこいいです！\nみんな、なんでも作れちゃうんですねっ！","zh":"是的，每一件都非——常帅气！\n大家真的什么都能做出来呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e92ccf53c8ed65d2c7983648fe03dc1a81cad92ce3a11759ec54640d8f02ca40","ja":"私たちのアイディアを形にしてもらえるなんて。\nすっごくすっごく、うれしいなーって♪","zh":"能把我们的想法化为现实，\n真的真的，好开心呀～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1737.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"66910c96b62f937d27fc353898454e27c38db8196f36fb04d6a5773ebd3a053e","ja":"うん、そうだね！　この流れで……もしかしたら\nいつか本当にグッズ化しちゃったりして。あははっ♪","zh":"嗯，也是呢！照这个势头……搞不好\n哪天真的会出周边商品呢。啊哈哈♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
